SPRINT PLAN: Self-Service Report Export Feature
================================================================================
Initiative: REPORT_EXPORT
Sprint Duration: 2 weeks (10 working days)
Sprint Dates: [TBD - Set at planning]

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VELOCITY CALCULATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Team Average Velocity: 28 points (historical average)
Capacity Adjustment: One developer on 50% PTO this sprint

Assumptions:
  - Team size: 4 developers
  - 1 developer at 50% availability = 0.5 developer capacity loss
  - Capacity reduction: 0.5/4 = 12.5% reduction

Adjusted Velocity: 28 points × 0.875 = ~24 points available

Planning Buffer: Reserve 15% for unexpected work/bugs
Effective Capacity: 24 × 0.85 = ~20 points committed

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
COMMITTED WORK (20 points)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These stories are committed to delivery this sprint:

Story #1 | MUST HAVE | 5 pts | End User - Basic CSV Export
  - Backend: CSV generation service
  - Frontend: Export button, download handling
  - Tests: Unit + integration tests for CSV output

Story #2 | MUST HAVE | 5 pts | End User - Basic PDF Export
  - Backend: PDF generation service with report styling
  - Frontend: Export button, download handling
  - Tests: PDF rendering verification

Story #3 | SHOULD HAVE | 3 pts | System - Export Confirmation Notification
  - Frontend: Toast/notification component
  - Backend: Success/failure response handling
  - Tests: Notification display tests

Story #8 | COULD HAVE | 1 pt | System - Export Filename Convention
  - Backend: Filename formatting utility
  - Tests: Filename generation tests

Story #7 | COULD HAVE | 2 pts | System - Export History for Users
  - Backend: Export history storage
  - Frontend: History list view
  - Tests: History CRUD operations

Story #6 | COULD HAVE | 3 pts | Administrator - Export Permissions Toggle
  - Backend: Permission check middleware
  - Frontend: Admin permission toggle UI
  - Tests: Permission enforcement tests

Story #5 | SHOULD HAVE | 5 pts | Administrator - Export Audit Log (Partial)
  - Backend: Audit logging middleware
  - Frontend: Basic admin audit view
  - Tests: Log entry verification

COMMITTED TOTAL: 24 points (slightly over capacity for buffer absorption)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STRETCH WORK (8 points)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These stories will be attempted if committed work is ahead of schedule:

Story #4 | SHOULD HAVE | 8 pts | Power User - Filtered Export
  - Backend: Filter state capture in export
  - Frontend: Filter indication in export file
  - Tests: Filtered export accuracy tests
  - Note: High value but depends on base exports being stable

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPRINT MILESTONES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Day 1-2: Setup & Foundation
  - Sprint kickoff, story refinement
  - Branch creation, CI/CD pipeline setup
  - CSV export backend implementation start

Day 3-4: Core Export Features
  - Complete CSV export (#1)
  - Begin PDF export implementation (#2)
  - Filename convention utility (#8)

Day 5-6: Mid-Sprint Review
  - Demo CSV and PDF exports
  - Address any blockers
  - Begin notification system (#3)

Day 7-8: Admin Features
  - Audit logging (#5 - partial)
  - Permission toggle (#6)
  - Export history (#7)

Day 9: Stretch & Polish
  - Attempt filtered export (#4) if capacity allows
  - Bug fixes, edge case handling
  - Documentation updates

Day 10: Sprint Close
  - Final testing, QA sign-off
  - Sprint retrospective
  - Demo to stakeholders

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RISKS & MITIGATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Risk: PDF generation complexity exceeds estimate
  Mitigation: Use proven library (e.g., Puppeteer, wkhtmltopdf)

Risk: Developer PTO creates knowledge gaps
  Mitigation: Document critical decisions, pair programming before PTO

Risk: Export performance on large datasets
  Mitigation: Implement async export with progress tracking

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINITION OF DONE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[ ] Code implemented and reviewed
[ ] Unit tests passing (>80% coverage)
[ ] Integration tests passing
[ ] Documentation updated
[ ] Feature flagged/ready for release
[ ] Demo completed to stakeholders

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUCCESS CRITERIA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- End users can export reports to CSV and PDF
- Exports include correct data and formatting
- Users receive clear export confirmation
- Admin can view audit logs of exports

================================================================================
END OF SPRINT PLAN
================================================================================
EOF

